    {
      "id": "technology/epoll-slow-consumer",
      "slug": "epoll-slow-consumer",
      "title": "epoll 与慢消费者：先看就绪队列",
      "description": "从就绪事件、应用队列和消费速率三个层次定位一次 epoll 服务中的慢消费者问题。",
      "bodyMarkdown": "## 先区分两种堆积\n\n`epoll_wait` 返回得快，不代表请求已经被及时消费。内核就绪队列和应用任务队列需要分别观测[^window]。\n\n```cpp file=\"consumer.cpp\" showLineNumbers\nconst auto ready = epoll_wait(fd, events, capacity, timeout_ms);\nqueue_depth.observe(worker_queue.size()); // [!code highlight]\n```\n\n## 再限制单次处理量\n\n一次取走过多事件会让其他连接等待。固定批次上限，并在队列持续增长时降低非关键任务的进入速率。\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  Socket --> ReadyQueue\n  ReadyQueue --> WorkerQueue\n  WorkerQueue --> Consumer\n```\n\n[^window]: 两个队列应使用同一采样窗口，否则趋势无法直接比较。\n",
      "pubDatetime": "2026-08-29T00:00:00.000Z",
      "modDatetime": "2026-08-30T02:00:00.000Z",
      "channel": "technology",
      "topics": [
        "systems-programming",
        "concurrency-engineering"
      ],
      "primaryTopic": "systems-programming",
      "tags": [
        "Linux",
        "epoll",
        "C++",
        "performance"
      ],
      "kind": "article",
